      "body": "The rest ktest code in sync module cannot be proved.\n\nThis PR \n- Completes the reference–permission and alignment specifications in sync::rcu::non_null.\n- Adds new third party spec for `<NonNull<T> as core::cmp::PartialEq>::eq`\n~~Separates linear Arc ownership permissions from borrowed read permissions, preventing duplicate ownership recovery and borrowed-to-owned permission escalation.~~\n~~Preserves Arc allocation identity across raw-pointer conversions. Borrowed handles use ManuallyDrop to avoid incorrectly decrementing the reference count.~~\n- Keeps Arc ownership permissions private and linear, preventing duplicate ownership recovery through the modeled owning conversion API.\n- Documents the unresolved Arc allocation-identity and borrowed-conversion verification limitations.",
